B.a2w=new A.bc("Small steps still move you forward.","Panpanskii reminder","You do not have to finish everything today. Choose one gentle next step.")
B.a3d=new A.bc("Be patient with the version of you that is still learning.","Daily wisdom","Growth can look quiet. Give yourself room to learn without rushing the process.")
B.a3U=new A.bc("Kindness is never wasted.","Daily wisdom","A thoughtful word can stay with someone longer than you realize. Lead with warmth today.")
B.a2t=new A.bc("You can begin again, even from a difficult day.","Daily wisdom","Yesterday does not get to decide the shape of today. Start where you are.")
B.a3R=new A.bc("Rest is part of the work, not a reward for finishing it.","Daily wisdom","Protect a little quiet time today. A rested heart notices more good things.")
B.a3p=new A.bc("What you water with attention will grow.","Daily wisdom","Give your time to the people, habits, and hopes you want to keep close.")
B.a2N=new A.bc("Courage can be soft and still be real.","Daily wisdom","You do not need to feel fearless. Showing up gently is already brave.")
B.a3S=new A.bc("There is beauty in an ordinary day shared with someone you love.","Daily wisdom","Notice one simple moment today and let it be enough.")
B.a2P=new A.bc("Your feelings are visitors; listen to them, but let them pass.","Daily wisdom","Name what you feel without letting one difficult moment define you.")
B.a3I=new A.bc("Hope is a practice, not just a feeling.","Daily wisdom","Choose one hopeful action, even if it is very small.")
B.a2R=new A.bc("A grateful heart makes room for more light.","Daily wisdom","Name one thing you appreciate today and share it with your person.")
B.a2O=new A.bc("You are allowed to take up space and take your time.","Daily wisdom","Your needs matter too. Make one choice today that respects your own pace.")
B.a2H=new A.bc("Love grows where attention lives.","Communal wisdom","Offer one moment of full attention today. Presence often says more than a perfect response.")
B.a2z=new A.bc("Being known begins with being honest.","Communal wisdom","Share one true little thing about your day and make room for your person to do the same.")
B.a2Q=new A.bc("A gentle answer can change the whole conversation.","Communal wisdom","Slow down before replying. A softer tone can help both hearts stay open.")
B.a3F=new A.bc("Together does not have to mean identical.","Communal wisdom","Let your differences add color to the relationship instead of treating them as distance.")
B.a2U=new A.bc("Reliable love often looks wonderfully ordinary.","Communal wisdom","Notice the repeated acts of care that quietly make everyday life feel safer.")
B.a3k=new A.bc("Listen for the feeling beneath the words.","Communal wisdom","Before solving anything, try naming what your person may be feeling and ask if you understood.")
B.a3K=new A.bc("A shared laugh can loosen a difficult day.","Communal wisdom","Find one harmless reason to be playful together, even if the day has been heavy.")
B.a31=new A.bc("Care is often clearest in the smallest details.","Communal wisdom","Remember one preference, task, or comfort that matters to your person and act on it.")
B.a2W=new A.bc("Closeness needs both warmth and room to breathe.","Communal wisdom","Offer affection without crowding each other. Healthy space can make returning feel sweeter.")
B.a2v=new A.bc("Repair is one of love's quiet skills.","Communal wisdom","A sincere apology and one changed action can turn a rough moment into deeper trust.")
B.a2M=new A.bc("Choose curiosity before assumption.","Communal wisdom","Ask what your person meant instead of filling the silence with the hardest interpretation.")
B.a3o=new A.bc("Speak to yourself like someone worth caring for.","Communal wisdom","Replace one harsh inner sentence with words you would lovingly offer your closest person.")
B.a3G=new A.bc("You do not need to earn softness.","Communal wisdom","Let yourself receive rest, patience, and care before every task is complete.")
B.a3g=new A.bc("Imperfect progress still belongs to you.","Communal wisdom","Notice what moved forward, even if the result is smaller or messier than you imagined.")
B.a3q=new A.bc("Your pace is not proof of your worth.","Communal wisdom","Move at the speed that keeps you well enough to remain present for your own life.")
B.a2s=new A.bc("A resting heart is still a worthy heart.","Communal wisdom","Give yourself a pause without turning it into another task to perform perfectly.")
B.a3Q=new A.bc("Mistakes are evidence that you participated.","Communal wisdom","Keep the lesson and release the need to replay every imperfect detail.")
B.a3W=new A.bc("Begin with compassion, then decide what needs to change.","Communal wisdom","Understanding yourself clearly is more useful than punishing yourself quickly.")
B.a3e=new A.bc("You can be proud and still be growing.","Communal wisdom","Celebrate the person you are while making gentle room for the person you are becoming.")
B.a3r=new A.bc("Boundaries are kindness with clear edges.","Communal wisdom","A respectful no can protect the energy needed for your most meaningful yes.")
B.a3t=new A.bc("Not every thought deserves your trust.","Communal wisdom","Pause before believing the loudest worry. Look for facts, context, and a kinder possibility.")
B.a3u=new A.bc("Give yourself the patience you offer people you love.","Communal wisdom","Let learning take time and speak gently to the unfinished parts of your journey.")
B.a2x=new A.bc("Growth rarely announces itself while it is happening.","Communal wisdom","Look back with kindness. You may already handle something better than an earlier version of you could.")
B.a2L=new A.bc("Small habits quietly write long stories.","Communal wisdom","Choose one repeatable action that points toward the life you want instead of chasing one perfect day.")
B.a3L=new A.bc("Becoming takes repetition.","Communal wisdom","Practice the quality you value in one ordinary moment. Character grows through small returns.")
B.a3X=new A.bc("You can change direction without calling the past a waste.","Communal wisdom","Carry forward what you learned and allow a new choice to be an honest form of growth.")
B.a35=new A.bc("Learn slowly enough to keep the lesson.","Communal wisdom","Understanding that lasts is more valuable than rushing to look finished.")
B.a3P=new A.bc("Confidence often arrives after the first brave action.","Communal wisdom","Take one manageable step before waiting to feel completely ready.")
B.a3A=new A.bc("A good question can open a door that certainty missed.","Communal wisdom","Stay curious about one situation today instead of deciding too quickly what it means.")
B.a3l=new A.bc("Keep a little room for the beginner in you.","Communal wisdom","Try something without demanding immediate excellence. Discovery needs permission to be awkward.")
B.a3w=new A.bc("Outgrowing something is not a betrayal of who you were.","Communal wisdom","Thank an old habit or dream for what it gave you, then notice whether it still fits.")
B.a2K=new A.bc("Discipline feels kinder when it serves your values.","Communal wisdom","Connect one task to the reason it matters instead of relying only on pressure.")
B.a2Y=new A.bc("Celebrate the evidence that you are becoming.","Communal wisdom","Name one recent choice that reflects the person you hope to be.")
B.a3Y=new A.bc("Balance is an adjustment, not a fixed destination.","Communal wisdom","Notice which part of life needs a little more care today and shift gently toward it.")
B.a2o=new A.bc("Quiet can be deeply productive.","Communal wisdom","Leave a few minutes unfilled and let your thoughts settle without forcing an outcome.")
B.a3v=new A.bc("You cannot offer full presence from constant hurry.","Communal wisdom","Slow one transition today so your attention can arrive where your body already is.")
B.a3C=new A.bc("Fewer priorities can make a day richer.","Communal wisdom","Choose what truly matters today and let lesser tasks wait without guilt.")
B.a3a=new A.bc("The body notices what the calendar ignores.","Communal wisdom","Check your thirst, hunger, tension, and tiredness before adding another demand.")
B.a3c=new A.bc("A pause is where wisdom catches up.","Communal wisdom","Take one breath between feeling and reacting. That small space can protect what matters.")
B.a3h=new A.bc("Sleep is care you give tomorrow in advance.","Communal wisdom","Prepare one small thing tonight that makes true rest easier to choose.")
B.a2I=new A.bc("Leave a little margin around your life.","Communal wisdom","An unscheduled pocket of time can hold rest, surprise, or the conversation you did not expect.")
B.a3B=new A.bc("Not every invitation is an assignment.","Communal wisdom","You may appreciate an opportunity without being required to accept it.")
B.a3N=new A.bc("Gentle routines can hold you on difficult days.","Communal wisdom","Keep one simple caring ritual that asks little and gives your day a steady shape.")
B.a2A=new A.bc("Enough is a peaceful word.","Communal wisdom","Decide what enough looks like for one task today, then allow yourself to stop.")
B.a2q=new A.bc("Courage often looks like returning.","Communal wisdom","Come back to one meaningful effort after a setback, even if you return with a smaller step.")
B.a3y=new A.bc("Uncertainty leaves room for a kind possibility too.","Communal wisdom","If you do not know what will happen, resist treating the hardest outcome as a fact.")
B.a2B=new A.bc("Hope can begin as one tiny practical choice.","Communal wisdom","Do one thing that assumes tomorrow is worth preparing for.")
B.a2X=new A.bc("The next step does not need to reveal the whole path.","Communal wisdom","Choose the clearest small action and let later decisions wait for later information.")
B.a2S=new A.bc("Sometimes bravery is being willing to ask.","Communal wisdom","Request the help, clarity, or company you need instead of carrying every uncertainty alone.")
B.a3D=new A.bc("A difficult chapter cannot summarize your whole story.","Communal wisdom","Let today be one page rather than a permanent conclusion about your life.")
B.a3z=new A.bc("Keep one light on for possibility.","Communal wisdom","Name one outcome that could go gently, even while you prepare wisely for challenges.")
B.a3H=new A.bc("Fear may speak, but it does not need the final word.","Communal wisdom","Hear what fear wants to protect, then let your values help choose the response.")
B.a39=new A.bc("Naming a hard thing can make it more workable.","Communal wisdom","Describe the next challenge clearly and without exaggeration, then identify what is within reach.")
B.a2J=new A.bc("Begin before every condition becomes perfect.","Communal wisdom","Use what is available and let the first attempt teach you what preparation could not.")
B.a3O=new A.bc("Tomorrow is allowed to feel different from today.","Communal wisdom","Leave room for new energy, new information, and a kinder turn than you can currently imagine.")
B.a2E=new A.bc("Gratitude teaches attention where to rest.","Communal wisdom","Choose one good detail and stay with it for a few breaths instead of rushing past.")
B.a3_=new A.bc("Joy does not need a special occasion.","Communal wisdom","Use the favorite cup, play the happy song, or enjoy the treat on an ordinary day.")
B.a2y=new A.bc("Ordinary moments become precious through attention.","Communal wisdom","Look closely at one familiar part of today as if you were saving it for future you.")
B.a2Z=new A.bc("Appreciation grows warmer when it is spoken.","Communal wisdom","Tell someone exactly what they did and why it mattered to you.")
B.a2T=new A.bc("Notice what is working as carefully as what needs fixing.","Communal wisdom","Name one strength in yourself, your person, or your routine that deserves to continue.")
B.a33=new A.bc("Good news becomes sweeter when it is shared.","Communal wisdom","Bring one small win to someone who will celebrate without making it smaller.")
B.a2F=new A.bc("Delight is useful nourishment.","Communal wisdom","Make room for something charming or funny simply because it helps you feel alive.")
B.a2D=new A.bc("Favorite rituals turn time into belonging.","Communal wisdom","Repeat one small tradition that reminds both of you this life is shared.")
B.a3J=new A.bc("Beauty asks first for attention.","Communal wisdom","Pause for a color, sound, face, or view that would be easy to miss while rushing.")
B.a3j=new A.bc("A small completion deserves a real moment of pride.","Communal wisdom","Mark one finished task before immediately replacing it with the next demand.")
B.a3n=new A.bc("Laughter is one way a grateful heart breathes.","Communal wisdom","Welcome a little silliness today without asking whether it is productive.")
B.a3x=new A.bc("Clarity is a form of care.","Communal wisdom","Say what you mean with warmth instead of asking someone to guess what would help.")
B.a34=new A.bc("Understanding does not require identical opinions.","Communal wisdom","Try to describe the other view fairly before explaining where your own view differs.")
B.a2p=new A.bc("One more honest question can prevent a long assumption.","Communal wisdom","When something feels unclear, ask gently rather than building a complete story alone.")
B.a2u=new A.bc("An honest conversation can still be tender.","Communal wisdom","Tell the truth in a way that protects dignity, including your own.")
B.a36=new A.bc("An apology becomes trustworthy through changed behavior.","Communal wisdom","Pair sincere words with one specific action that makes the same hurt less likely.")
B.a3s=new A.bc("People feel closer when their experience is witnessed.","Communal wisdom","Before offering advice, let someone know that you see why the moment mattered.")
B.a2V=new A.bc("Community is built through repeated welcome.","Communal wisdom","Include someone, remember a detail, or make one familiar space feel warmer today.")
B.a2C=new A.bc("Generosity can be time, attention, or patience.","Communal wisdom","Give in a way that is sustainable and genuinely useful, even if it costs nothing.")
B.a32=new A.bc("Specific encouragement travels farther.","Communal wisdom","Name the effort or quality you admire instead of offering only a general compliment.")
B.a30=new A.bc("Letting someone finish is a small act of respect.","Communal wisdom","Stay with the full thought before preparing your reply.")
B.a3E=new A.bc("Belonging grows where people are allowed to be real.","Communal wisdom","Offer a response that makes honesty safer than pretending everything is fine.")
B.a3M=new A.bc("Purpose often hides inside what you repeat.","Communal wisdom","Notice which ordinary actions express the values you want your life to hold.")
B.a37=new A.bc("A meaningful life is assembled from ordinary choices.","Communal wisdom","Choose one small action today that future you would recognize as important.")
B.a3T=new A.bc("Care for the spaces that care for you.","Communal wisdom","Tend one corner of your room, routine, or relationship that helps you feel grounded.")
B.a3i=new A.bc("One thoughtful choice can anchor an entire day.","Communal wisdom","Pick a simple intention and return to it whenever the day becomes noisy.")
B.a2G=new A.bc("Keep promises small enough to keep.","Communal wisdom","A modest commitment honored consistently builds more trust than a dramatic promise forgotten.")
B.a38=new A.bc("Spend attention where your values live.","Communal wisdom","Give a few uninterrupted minutes to a person or purpose you say matters.")
B.a3m=new A.bc("Home is a feeling built through habits.","Communal wisdom","Create one repeated gesture that makes returning to each other feel safe and familiar.")
B.a3f=new A.bc("Plans can guide you, but presence tells you why.","Communal wisdom","Look up from the schedule long enough to notice the life the plan is meant to support.")
B.a3V=new A.bc("Practice tomorrow's values in today's small choices.","Communal wisdom","Act once like the future person you hope to become instead of waiting for a perfect new chapter.")
B.a3b=new A.bc("Simplicity can reveal what is already enough.","Communal wisdom","Remove one unnecessary layer and notice whether the essential thing becomes clearer.")
B.a2r=new A.bc("End the day by noticing what carried you.","Communal wisdom","Name a person, habit, hope, or small comfort that helped you make it through today.")
